    "answer": {
      "short": "$225\\text{ kg}$",
      "worked": "Weight of the matches:\n$$\\begin{align*}10\\,000\\times100\\times0.00015&=150\\text{ kg}\\end{align*}$$\nWeight of the empty boxes:\n$$\\begin{align*}10\\,000\\times0.0075&=75\\text{ kg}\\end{align*}$$\nTotal weight:\n$$\\begin{align*}150+75&=225\\text{ kg}\\end{align*}$$",
